Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really do appreciate\Nyou lending us a bus fare.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't come with\Nyou, we can't do our job!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll haunt you and your children\Nand your children's children, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I knew it was a mistake,\Nbut I couldn't take the whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.14,0:01:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.06,0:02:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, you can shower me with\Nall the appreciation you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you pay\Nme back when we hit town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.14,0:02:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wallet's almost empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I really getting through to this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little bit thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that I can\Nhave some of your water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting through to her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you keep it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you noticed that\Neveryone here is exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the terrible ordeal\Nin the sand steamer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I've shut him up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't be causing any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't think you had to hit me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is one heck of a\Nwell-prepared dead guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, praise the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, have some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm alive again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm much obliged. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that was my...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you doing out in\Nthe middle of the desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my bike decided to break down on me about\N100 aisles or so down the road from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd just hoof it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you\Nactually walked 100 aisles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.75,0:03:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was pretty horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, it must have been awfully tiring to\Nwalk carrying that huge thing on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't leave it behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do have my pride as a tradesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tradesman?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a man of the cloth. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.26,0:03:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you like make pretty dresses? Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a priest saving the lambs\Nwho have strayed off their path.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:03:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soldier of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You girls are the ones who\Nspotted me, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life. Well, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one that spotted you\Nwhen you were nothing but a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.44,0:04:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tiny little speck on the\Nhorizon was that pathetic guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive because of what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I ever thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am known as Valentines\NAlcalinella Zijak Shushirabo Heretz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gumbi Gobella, Blue Stradivari, Talent\NTrent Pierre, Andre Chartenhamos,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yvato Vinci Baldos George,\NDeutzel Kaiser III.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate it when you call\Nme by my full name!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean to say he's\NTHE Vash the Stampede?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can this man really be him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's absolutely nothing\Nat all like I envisioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:05:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know I have\Ntrouble believing it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, gee, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Wolfwood, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life sure can be funny sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine running into the legendary\Noutlaw in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't broadcast it to\Nthe whole world, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I shot you dead right now and\Ncollected the 60 billion double dollars,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have a really fun journey, wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I weren't listening, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got any more water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would, but you drank it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, they seem to be\Ngetting along really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The birds of the feather\Nhave flocked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a long trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta go sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, mister, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please count it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four,\Nfive, six, seven, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recount it all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you, the fare is\None hundred double dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I give you any more,\NI'll die of starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, driver, please, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you ride for\Neighty double dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it or leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be great! Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a confessional.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, those private rooms they\Nused to have in the churches back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one is portable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have something to confess\Nsome blasphemous act and indiscretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, thanks Padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh well now he's not much fun Looks\Nlike you've got a pretty tough job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that thing part of your gospel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all business
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our church kind of doubles as an orphanage\Nwe scrape out a living doing what we can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we taken all these kids with no living
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,family no place to go\Nguess it was time I left
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the church anyway I\Ndecided it was a hopeless
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,effort unless I made some money for them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you saying you make money as a priest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well I I wouldn't\Nexactly put it like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.22,0:07:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be in the city sooner\Nthan you think, girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and once we get there, I'll\Ngive you plenty to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient for Mommy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.28,0:07:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be that way, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only gonna be a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want food now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.85,0:07:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're little, but\Nthey taste pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:07:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this one is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then this one, uh, is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry it's not much, but you\Nthink it'll be enough for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.28,0:08:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I woke up a crumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.26,0:08:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually surprised that\Nyou can smile like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.28,0:08:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had me kind of worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I noticed that you always\Nsmile and seem really friendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the way you smiled was so\Nempty, it hurt to watch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurting like crazy on the\Ninside, yet you grin and bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least that's this man's opinion anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I have this confessional!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what the\Nworry, I'll listen to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just put a coin in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really good at your trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to be to make a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not easy, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eric is completely crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.48,0:09:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it was bound to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is getting worse
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Eric, buddy, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get the stretcher over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just fallen down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't really look that bad
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anyone here,\Nbut the passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why are you pointing that thing at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it was you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was no mortal that did\Nthis. Huh? Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.57,0:10:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't anything nice ever follow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, it's a real drag, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those ugly things?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunts of lost technology?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all because I changed my route\Nto save that stupid cheap priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have charged him full price.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can they still be operational?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.88,0:10:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their expiration date was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not look it, but I am a priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I have a book on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind. I'll do it. Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Helen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.24,0:11:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of the wounded man! Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ask ridiculous questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna save the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your bare hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would have gone anyway, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see him, I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's lots of those big guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I bet those are nothing for the\Nlikes of Vash the Stampede, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach kinda hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on now, tough guy, get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not that fragile, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.50,0:12:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got shot by the leader of the\NBad Lads about three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got shot by Brilliant Dynamites Neon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do lead an exciting\Nlife, just like they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.76,0:12:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You listen to people,\Nand then again you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A child's life is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look for a second, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They use that thing on the end to\Ndetect objects which radiate heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to just\Nsit around and chit-chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ID has not been registered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.96,0:13:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you may not enter this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will now be removed by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.06,0:13:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice support!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you were a nice decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what's known as a nice cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.28,0:13:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the decoy that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice support.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still alive, and she looks okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Praise the Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:13:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievably fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounded like a single gunshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.32,0:14:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Bash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.82,0:14:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like we're\Njust about done, huh? Nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an embarrassing way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really fell into it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're smack in the middle\Nof their territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.69,0:14:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the inside of an alien ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're telling me we\Ndiscovered some kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spaceship that crashed\Nhere a long time ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious to know what's inside\Nthe belly of this monster whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I know what they're saying, I\Nfeel so pissed off at you all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're around, things\Nalways seem to get much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brain's about to explode into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your fault! Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fell in all by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.70,0:15:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's I got to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should take five here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this is making me hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.46,0:15:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the children, you seem\Nto be a bit more generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am eternally grateful for your\Nhumanity in this most extreme situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you want to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost 80 billion double dollars at\Npoker, but there's a little left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, a real man would\Nlay it all on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then, let's\Nfind ourselves a casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plant's fully operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.66,0:16:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an awfully big casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, where are the cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go. You cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:17:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I have to tell you, I've\Nnever fired a gun before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I go ahead and take this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't that mean you're going\Nin there completely unarmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll shoot the gun. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shuffle the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.53,0:17:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May you go with the protection\Nand love of Almighty God!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.84,0:17:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the usual mantra for The big guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's entirely up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonderful mantra you got there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believers will be redeemed in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Jay, let's get in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's precise shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's no ordinary priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please show your ID number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unable to confirm identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conclusion, intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you just get out of my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.48,0:18:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.36,0:18:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night what
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happened back there what
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you mean don't play dumb with me I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,asking what you did back there it must\Nhave been God it's the only explanation?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.62,0:19:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, there's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are the two of you down there somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.66,0:19:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's us, Milly and Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.38,0:19:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're there, give us a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there may be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little late, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can get out of the worst\Npredicaments imaginable,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just like they say, Vash the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd much rather lead an uneventful\Nlife if it was up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't if you tried. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I sit here? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're really comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that guy sure has a lot of nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, he reminds me of someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, isn't he horrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should tell him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.27,0:21:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.19,0:21:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Great, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.01,0:21:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.93,0:21:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.75,0:21:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.66,0:21:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My back hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.49,0:21:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My back hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot for all the support, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, it was a fun and interesting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're leaving now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.06,0:21:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta get back to work, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.97,0:21:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, preacher man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that thing's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.84,0:21:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That, my friend, is because\Nit's so full of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:21:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stay out of trouble, Vash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.60,0:22:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone around you will be\Na whole lot healthier for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with any luck, we'll meet again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May you all go with God, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a strange and unusual man. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there went Wolfwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think I'll go get\Nsomething good to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, that sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I need you to\Nreturn the money I lent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.38,0:22:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright already, we'll give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.14,0:22:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like you don't know\Nwhere to find us or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blue sky in the middle of the\Nsky, the wind is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:23:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.30,0:23:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But i'll just
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.30,0:23:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave my eyes. With my eyes and eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.00,0:23:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.44,0:24:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like to do\Nsomething nice for somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's good if you smile at\Nsomeone and they smile in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.08,0:24:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voluntary love encourages people\Nto create a sense of friendliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.50,0:24:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love that is unconditional\Ngives us respect as people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.82,0:24:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it's wrong to force\Nlove to try to keep it alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.22,0:24:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the strain goes on, eventually\Nit'll bloom into the flower called lye,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the deceptively thorny\Nflower that hurts people.

